A photorealistic image of two identical young Asian boys in school uniforms standing at the end of a suburban driveway in the soft blue-grey light of early dawn, their long shadows stretching behind them toward a warmly lit house window, a yellow school bus visible approaching in the misty distance, backpacks at their feet, the sky transitioning from deep indigo to pale orange on the horizon, dew glistening on grass and mailbox, capturing the quiet anticipation of a new morning routine beginning.
